/* ===================== European pre-qualifiers: every nation can work its way up ===================== */
// FIBA Europe: 32 nations play the European Qualifiers of a World Cup or EuroBasket; all the others play the Pre-Qualifiers in the same
// windows. At the end of a cycle the eight nations that did not reach the next stage of the qualifiers (fourth in a first-round group of
// the World Cup qualifiers, or not qualified for EuroBasket) go down, and eight move up from the pre-qualifiers. 2026/27 uses the real
// EuroBasket 2029 Pre-Qualifiers: second round (four groups of three, group winners up), third round in summer 2027 (group winners up).
const NT_Q32=['ESP','MNE','UKR','GEO','GRE','POR','TUR','ITA','SRB','LTU','ISL','BIH','POL','CRO','GER','ISR','NED','LAT','FIN','FRA','HUN','EST','SWE','SLO','BEL','CZE','GBR','AUT','ROU','BUL','SVK','SUI'];
